+# Lending library
+
+Node 22, ES modules, no dependencies. Run the tests with `npm test`, which runs `node --test` over each `*.test.js` file under `test/`.
+
+The catalogue of titles is a remote service; `RemoteCatalogue` is the only class that calls it.
